    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History API enables users to access historical transaction records of loyalty points accrued by customers. This endpoint provides detailed insights into a customer's loyalty points history, showcasing transactions, point balances, and redemption activity. It is primarily designed for hotel management systems, customer service representatives, and loyalty program administrators who need to analyze customer engagement and rewards interactions. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance loyalty strategies and improve customer retention efforts.",
